UI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onKeyPress(phases:action:)":{"abstract":[],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/onKeyPress(phases:action:)","title":"onKeyPress(phases:action:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onKeyPress"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"phases"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV","text":"KeyPress"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV6PhasesV","text":"Phases"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"action"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV","text":"KeyPress"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV","text":"KeyPress"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI8KeyPressV6ResultO","text":"Result"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text